<workout_file>
    <author>X2Max dashboard</author>
    <name>Heart-rate test · Zone steps</name>
    <description>18 min. Heart-rate targets in bpm (HeartRate is an X2Max-dashboard extra; Zwift ignores it). Ride by feel and hold the bpm. Change the numbers to fit your own zones.</description>
